{"id":"gratis","lemma":"gratis","pos":"adv","rank":1160,"glosses":["free, without charge"],"ipa":"/ˈɡɾatis/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/af/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-gratis.wav","examples":[{"text":"No hay nada gratis.","en":"Nothing is free.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/538297"},{"text":"Las bebidas eran gratis.","en":"The drinks were free.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454897"},{"text":"Asumí que era gratis.","en":"I assumed it was free.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453911"},{"text":"Este periódico es gratis.","en":"This newspaper is free.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461216"},{"text":"Obtuve gratis esta bicicleta.","en":"I got this bicycle for free.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/735490"}]}